/// unavailable, 1 callback) superseded by the T3 census (3 async ops, 7 leaves,
/// 0 callbacks) pinned in the X-R01-1 comparison table.
/// Protects: surface census; three ops, three failure leaves, one callback; operations
/// create, dispose, update; expected leaves chart::disposed, chart::invalid_spec, chart::unavailable.
/// Variants: all values/host faults enumerated in this declaration.
/// Environment: Bun prototype test environment (no live run; relevance decision needs no live qualification).
/// Delegated oracles: none. C/R/N/S/A: not bound (no retained behavior; no P23 port).
/// Shared old files untouched; integrator retires after linked rows and callers resolve.
record disposition
    str row
    str verdict
    str live_owner
    str rationale
fn disposition decide
    emits {}
    given
